<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντομος</span></b> , ὁ, dialectic
		form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάτομος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stake</i> or <i>pale,</i>
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντομοι: σκόλοπες</span>
				(<span class="entity">Sicel</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: hence collectively, <i>paling, boundary-fence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Tab.Heracl.
				1.15
			</span></i>, al.; also, <i>road adjoining such a fence,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.13
			</span></i>, al.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
